\* Generated by formal/plx_formal.py from the ParallaXFragments tables.
\* Do not edit by hand. Run: python3 formal/plx_formal.py emit
\*
\* Bounded PX1F partitions, total/offset rejection, and completion reset before the next frame.
\*
\* Safety claims (states and steps that must be unreachable):
\*   FragmentsStayWithinTotal: a partial payload cannot exceed its latched total
\*   EmitOnlyCompleteFrame: only an exactly complete frame can be returned
\*   CompletionClearsLatch: a returned frame clears the latch and buffer before reuse
\*   RejectedChunkEmitsNothing: a malformed or inconsistent chunk emits no frame
\*   PartialChunkEmitsNothing: a partial chunk remains buffered
\*   FrameCountIsBounded: two frames suffice to exercise completion and reuse

